// lustre, reviewed against the source of every release from 5.0.0 to 5.7.1.
// The element, attribute, event, effect and component builders only hold
// what they are given. Starting or registering an application runs it;
// rendering or querying an element runs the views it holds (memoised
// elements, from 5.5.0); performing an effect runs it. What an application
// built by application, simple or component carries is undescribed.

covers 5.0.0 to 5.7.1
